      ],
      "plan": "The plan is to present a conceptual VRAM allocation strategy. The post will explicitly state its hypothetical nature and avoid any claims of measured results. It will focus on separating model weights, KV cache, and other runtime needs to aid users in their own planning. The target audience is technically informed readers interested in local LLM deployment. The goal is to initiate a discussion on planning methodologies rather than present definitive solutions."
